Dialogue: 11,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.16,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}This world is a false reality
Dialogue: 11,0:00:21.16,0:00:27.25,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}It’s merely a vision projected into our eyes
Dialogue: 11,0:00:28.17,0:00:33.63,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}The arbiter at the point at infinity
Dialogue: 11,0:00:33.63,0:00:39.05,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Is overwriting the abnormalities of this universe
Dialogue: 11,0:00:39.05,0:00:44.39,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}If an arrogant God, imperceptible by our eyes
Dialogue: 11,0:00:44.39,0:00:48.73,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Maintains control over us with the speed of light
Dialogue: 11,0:00:48.73,0:00:54.11,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Then I—and merely I—
Dialogue: 11,0:00:54.11,0:01:00.82,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Will be sufficient, as a miraculous and fatal minority
Dialogue: 11,0:01:01.95,0:01:07.25,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}If that moment, that place, was special to you
Dialogue: 11,0:01:07.79,0:01:12.71,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Then the past isn’t merely something that’s expanding our distance
Dialogue: 11,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.42,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}All the pain and misery
Dialogue: 11,0:01:15.42,0:01:18.26,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Of that crucial scene—
Dialogue: 11,0:01:18.26,0:01:23.60,OP Trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur11.25}Its light will now manifest “0”
